 first thing tomorrow morning!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4770672752/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4778387522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120551#issuecomment-4778387522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551","id":4778387522,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHNBoQg","user":{"login":"gebojiang","id":250485739,"node_id":"U_kgDODu4b6w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250485739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang","html_url":"https://github.com/gebojiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T10:49:21Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T10:49:21Z","body":"Added a second commit to optimize the performance.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4778387522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4825945561","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120551#issuecomment-4825945561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551","id":4825945561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH6YV2Q","user":{"login":"gebojiang","id":250485739,"node_id":"U_kgDODu4b6w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250485739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang","html_url":"https://github.com/gebojiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T11:28:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T11:28:23Z","body":"Hi @AThousandShips,\r\n\r\nI have completely reworked this PR. After taking a step back, I realized my previous approach (refactoring the reference system to use ObjectID and adding runtime validation across all modifier classes) was overly complex and introduced unnecessary overhead.\r\n\r\nI have force-pushed a new, much lighter solution—going for a more elegant, \"geeky\" approach to fix this crash at its root. Instead of checking for validity during every execution frame, I implemented a simple destructor callback. By just nullifying the modification_stack pointer inside Skeleton2D::~Skeleton2D() when the node is freed, the dangling pointer issue is resolved safely.\r\n\r\nThis reduces the fix to just 3 lines of code without altering the existing API or affecting IK performance. Thank you for your patience and review!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4825945561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]